## 1. Flights – Cheapest Connecting Flights

### API Call (searchFlightsMultiStops)

```json
{
  "legs": [
    {
      "fromId": "LAX.AIRPORT",
      "toId": "JFK.AIRPORT",
      "date": "2024-11-10"
    },
    {
      "fromId": "JFK.AIRPORT",
      "toId": "LAX.AIRPORT",
      "date": "2024-11-20"
    }
  ],
  "adults": 1,
  "cabinClass": "ECONOMY",
  "sort": "CHEAPEST"
}
```

**Result (example)** – *prices are illustrative; the API will return the exact fare.*

| Flight | Departs | Arrives | Duration | Price |
|--------|---------|---------|----------|-------|
| **Outbound** | 10 Nov 2024 10:00 AM (LAX) | 10 Nov 2024 6:30 PM (JFK) | 5 h 30 m | **$210** |
| **Return** | 20 Nov 2024 10:00 AM (JFK) | 20 Nov 2024 6:30 PM (LAX) | 5 h 30 m | **$210** |

> *If you prefer a different departure time, the API will list all cheapest options.  
> *The flight times above are typical for a 5‑hour 30‑minute non‑stop LAX–JFK flight.*

---

## 2. Car Rental – One‑Way Rental at JFK

### 2.1 Find the Rental Location

```json
{
  "query": "JFK Airport"
}
```

The API will return the coordinates:

```json
{
  "latitude": 40.6413,
  "longitude": -73.7781,
  "name": "JFK Airport Car Rental Center"
}
```

### 2.2 Book the Rental

```json
{
  "pick_up_latitude": 40.6413,
  "pick_up_longitude": -73.7781,
  "drop_off_latitude": 40.6413,
  "drop_off_longitude": -73.7781,
  "pick_up_date": "2024-11-10",
  "pick_up_time": "19:30",
  "drop_off_date": "2024-11-20",
  "drop_off_time": "08:00",
  "pick_up_location_id": "JFK_AIRPORT",
  "drop_off_location_id": "JFK_AIRPORT"
}
```

**Typical cost** – *again, illustrative; the API will return the exact price.*

| Rental Company | Vehicle | Daily Rate | Total (10 days) |
|----------------|---------|------------|-----------------|
| Hertz | Compact | $45 | **$450** |
| Avis | Compact | $47 | **$470** |
| Enterprise | Compact | $44 | **$440** |

> *All three companies offer a “one‑way” option that lets you pick up and drop off at the same location.  
> *The pickup time is set to 1 hour after the flight lands (≈ 7:30 PM).  
> *The return time is set to 2 hours before the flight departs (≈ 8:00 AM).*

